<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Rentiersky CZK 89 mln H1 pretax.</title>
<headline>Czech Rentiersky CZK 89 mln H1 pretax.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech investment fund IF Rentiersky a.s. results for first half 1997.</p>
<p>(millions of Czech crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax result		 89.056 profit  vs	102.856 loss</p>
<p> financial costs	     440.640	   vs    2,758.084</p>
<p> financial earnings	  514.995	   vs    2,655.226</p>
<p> basic capital	     1,765.653	   vs    1,765.653</p>
<p> short-term obligations     85.512	   vs    2,091.686</p>
<p> total assets		2,440.351	   vs    3,719.464</p>
<p>Note. Full name is Rentiersky Investicni Fond Prvni Investicni a.s., managed by Prvni Investicni a.s., a unit of bank Investicni a Postovni Banka a.s.. IPB held a 25 percent share in the fund, according to the Central Securities Registry's latest update in the middle of July.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
